<title>JAPAN: Toa Valve - 95/96 group results.</title>
<headline>Toa Valve - 95/96 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  9.97</p>
<p> Operating	  108    million</p>
<p> Current	     74    million</p>
<p> Net		  115    million</p>
<p> EPS		    6.89 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	   nil yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Toa Valve Co Ltd is a valve manufacturer.</p>
<p>The company has started to make earnings announcement on a</p>
<p>group basis from current fiscal year.</p>
